    "created_at": "2021-10-13T06:54:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-13T06:54:15Z",
    "body": "Fair. For Gecko it's something we'd probably consider implementing once we have all the other wide gamut features, but there isn't even a concrete half-float canvas API proposal yet, so it really seems quite far out there. And then I'm not sure to what extent the external color profile formats have been vetted. It certainly seems like the fetch pipeline has seen little attention. Do you know who to ask for Chromium? @smfr I guess color profiles are something you can comment on for WebKit?",
